# Elixir

Follow skills **elixir** and **poteto-elixir** when applicable.

- Formatter clean (`mix format` / `.formatter.exs` / CI `mix format --check-formatted`)
- **Credo** required in product wiring (`.credo.exs` and/or mix deps / CI)
- **dialyzer** (dialyxir) required in product wiring (mix dialyzer / dialyxir dep / CI)
- No `String.to_atom` on untrusted or external input without `elixir-rg-allow` + rationale; prefer `String.to_existing_atom` / allowlisted atoms
- No SQL string concat / interpolation of untrusted values without `elixir-rg-allow` + rationale; prefer Ecto binds / parameterized queries
- No `Process.sleep` on hot paths without `elixir-rg-allow` + rationale; prefer `Process.send_after` / receive / backoff supervisor
- Required product gates: `elixir-rg-gate` + `elixir-hotpath-gate` + `elixir-fmt-gate` + `elixir-credo-gate` + `elixir-dialyzer-gate`. Do not disable checks to force green.
- Prove runtime behaviour with mix test / ExUnit, not "format pass" alone

Repeated review smell twice on an Elixir product: encode into lint/CI/skill, not more prose.
